|i1 : R = ZZ/7[x,y,z]/(x^3+y^3+z^3);                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : X = Proj R;                                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : F = frobeniusPushforward(1, OO_X);                             |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : elapsedTime tallySummands summands F                           |
| -- try using changeBaseField with GF 49                            |
| -- try using changeBaseField with GF 49                            |
| -- try using changeBaseField with GF 49                            |
| -- 3.75566s elapsed                                                |
|                                                                    |
|o4 = Tally{cokernel {1} | x   -2z -3y -y  0   0   | => 1}           |
|                    {1} | 3z  -y  0   x   2z  -2y |                 |
|                    {1} | -3y x   z   -3z 0   0   |                 |
|                    {1} | 0   0   -3y y   x   -3z |                 |
|                    {1} | -2z 2y  x   0   -z  3y  |                 |
|                    {1} | 0   0   -z  -3z -2y x   |                 |
|           cokernel {1} | x   -z 2y  3y  0  0   | => 1              |
|                    {1} | -2z 3y 0   x   z  -y  |                   |
|                    {1} | 2y  x  -3z 2z  0  0   |                   |
|                    {1} | 0   0  2y  -3y x  2z  |                   |
|                    {1} | -z  y  x   0   3z -2y |                   |
|                    {1} | 0   0  3z  2z  -y x   |                   |
|           cokernel {1} | x  3z  y   -2y 0   0  | => 1              |
|                    {1} | -z -2y 0   x   -3z 3y |                   |
|                    {1} | y  x   2z  z   0   0  |                   |
|                    {1} | 0  0   y   2y  x   z  |                   |
|                    {1} | 3z -3y x   0   -2z -y |                   |
|                    {1} | 0  0   -2z z   3y  x  |                   |
|            1                                                       |
|           R  => 1                                                  |
