frobeniusMap -- the iterated Frobenius map of a ring in positive characteristic
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        frobeniusMap(e, R)
  * Inputs:
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, from the Frobenius source
        ring to the twisted target ring

Description
===========

This function constructs the $e$-th Frobenius ring map used by the pushforward
and pullback routines.

See also
========

  * *note frobeniusRing: frobeniusRing, -- construct the source ring for an
    iterated Frobenius map
  * *note frobeniusTwist: frobeniusTwist, -- apply the Frobenius twist to
    rings, modules, and matrices
  * *note frobeniusPushforward: frobeniusPushforward, -- compute Frobenius
    pushforwards
  * *note frobeniusPullback: frobeniusPullback, -- compute Frobenius pullbacks

