|      1      2      4      8      16      32       |
|o2 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R   <-- R         |
|                                                   |
|     0      1      2      3      4       5         |
|                                                   |
|o2 : Complex                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : netList isomorphismTally summands coker F.dd_5|
|                                                   |
|     +----------------------------------------+    |
|o3 = |(cokernel {7}  | x2   0 0  0 y4 0  |, 3)|    |
|     |          {8}  | -48y x y3 0 0  0  |    |    |
|     |          {10} | 0    0 0  y x  x2 |    |    |
|     +----------------------------------------+    |
|     |(cokernel {8} | y x |, 3)               |    |
|     +----------------------------------------+    |
|     |(cokernel {8} | x  0  y4 0   |, 2)      |    |
|     |          {8} | -y x2 0  xy3 |          |    |
|     +----------------------------------------+    |
+---------------------------------------------------+

